## Sequence of Execution

| Order | Scope Contract | Duration | Dependencies |
|-------|---------------|----------|--------------|
| 1 | Scope 1: Category Indirection Elimination | 3-4 days | None |
| 2 | Scope 2: Client Component Reduction | 2-3 days | None |
| 3 | Scope 3: Caching Infrastructure | 2 days | None |
| 4 | Scope 4: AI-Leverage Tier 3 | 2-3 days | None |

**Rationale:**
- **Scope 1 first** — Unblocks complete VFS migration, highest technical debt
- **Scope 2 parallel** — Bundle optimization independent of data layer
- **Scope 3 after 1** — Caching benefits from stable query patterns
- **Scope 4 last** — Developer productivity enhancement, lowest risk

