## Risk Mitigation

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Schema migration breaks existing filters | Maintain dual lookup during transition period |
| Client component conversion breaks UI | Test each conversion individually |
| Cache stale data | Short TTL (60s) initially, monitoring alerts |
| Migration data inconsistency | Backup before migration, verification script |

